+# Static IPFS Deployment
+
+These commands build a static Next.js export for IPFS. They do not run automatically here, and nothing is uploaded until you run the `ipfs add` command yourself.
+
+## 1. Prepare the deployment artifact
+
+Start the same local Base fork used for demos:
+
+```bash
+yarn workspace @se-2/foundry exec make fork FORK_URL=https://mainnet.base.org
+```
+
+In another terminal, deploy the contract so `packages/nextjs/contracts/deployedContracts.ts` contains the current local `TipJar` address:
+
+```bash
+yarn deploy
+```
+
+Build the static site:
+
+```bash
+yarn workspace @se-2/nextjs build:ipfs
+test -f packages/nextjs/out/index.html
+```
+
+## 2. Upload to IPFS
+
+With a local Kubo node installed and configured:
+
+```bash
+ipfs daemon
+```
+
+In another terminal:
+
+```bash
+CID=$(ipfs add -r --cid-version=1 --pin=true -Q packages/nextjs/out)
+echo $CID
+```
+
+The site path is:
+
+```bash
+echo "http://127.0.0.1:8080/ipfs/$CID/"
+```
+
+For a remote pinning provider, upload the contents of `packages/nextjs/out` as a directory and record the returned CID.
+
+## 3. Post-deploy verification
+
+Keep the Base fork running at `http://127.0.0.1:8545`; the static app targets that local chain ID.
+
+Verify the IPFS artifact resolves:
+
+```bash
+ipfs cat /ipfs/$CID/index.html >/tmp/tipjar-index.html
+test -s /tmp/tipjar-index.html
+```
+
+Verify the deployed contract and Base USDC wiring:
+
+```bash
+TIP_JAR=$(rg -o 'address: "0x[0-9a-fA-F]{40}"' packages/nextjs/contracts/deployedContracts.ts | head -n 1 | cut -d'"' -f2)
+cast code $TIP_JAR --rpc-url http://127.0.0.1:8545
+cast call $TIP_JAR "usdc()(address)" --rpc-url http://127.0.0.1:8545
+cast call $TIP_JAR "recipient()(address)" --rpc-url http://127.0.0.1:8545
+```
+
+The `usdc()` call must return:
+
+```text
+0x833589fCD6eDb6E08f4c7C32D4f71b54bdA02913
+```
+
+Open the local gateway URL, connect a wallet on `Localhost 8545`, and send a small fork-local tip. Then verify the event exists:
+
+```bash
+cast logs --rpc-url http://127.0.0.1:8545 --address $TIP_JAR 'TipReceived(address indexed,address indexed,uint256,string,uint256)'
+```
